body: |-
  ## Backend (server/)
  - `#auth-service` (src/services/auth.ts): bcrypt hashing (10 rounds), `users` table (uuid id, unique email, password_hash), signed JWT (`sub`=user id, 7d TTL). JWT_SECRET read lazily so /products works without it. createUser (409 on email conflict), authenticateUser, verifyToken.
  - `#auth-route` (src/routes/auth.ts): POST /auth/signup (201, 400 invalid_email/weak_password min 6, 409 email_taken), POST /auth/login (generic 401 invalid_credentials — no field leak). Both return { token, user }.
  - `#products-route` (src/routes/products.ts): public GET /products → { products: [{sku,name,price_usdc}] }, prices as strings.
  - `#checkout-route`: requireUserId now calls verifyToken (JWT) instead of Bearer=userId. `sub` claim → order user_id.
  - index.ts: added cors (origin = CLIENT_ORIGIN ?? true) and mounted auth + products routers.
  - wallet.ts: Circle client now lazy-inits on first use (circle() getter) instead of throwing at import — lets the server boot for products/auth without CIRCLE_API_KEY.
  - .env.example: added JWT_SECRET, CLIENT_ORIGIN. package.json: +bcryptjs, jsonwebtoken, cors (+types).

  ## Frontend (client/) — React 18 + Vite 5 + TS
  - api.ts (typed client, ApiError carrying status+body), auth.tsx (session context, JWT in localStorage), AuthPanel.tsx (login/signup toggle), Storefront.tsx (product grid + per-sku checkout), App.tsx shell, styles.css.
  - Checkout UX handles server spend-policy: 428 → in-app confirm button (NOT window.confirm, to avoid blocking) that resends checkoutConfirmed:true; 402 → cap message; 401 → logout + re-sign-in prompt; 200 → order placed.

  ## Paradigm
  - Updated routes/.purpose (+auth-route, +products-route), services/.purpose (+auth-service), portal.yaml (^authenticated now JWT; registered public routes). Reindexed.

  ## Not done / next
  - No runtime smoke test (needs DATABASE_URL + JWT_SECRET; wallet path needs Circle creds + MERCHANT_PAYOUT_ADDRESS).
  - Quantity fixed to 1 in the UI (no cart). No product images.
  - World ID selfie validation still deferred (future agent-purchase trigger).
